{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"3d93bb2db1c2918d8b34a9dc8444011745e5ee95d06ede5e8ab872d2cfdfc910","ja":"アイデンティティ★クライシス","zh":"身份危机★蕴含 crisis? Wait title natural \"身份★危机\" maybe Japanese compound アイデンティティ★クライシス = 身份认同★危机. Need title style. \"身份认同★危机\" best.","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6219f56e492a73824ab26a559de13572d8c26835c26fea9b1a170319b214952a","ja":"確かに、ハロウィンでもないのにトリックとか\nトリートとか……季節外れ感マシマシかも……。","zh":"确实，明明不是万圣节，却又是“不给糖就捣蛋”什么的……感觉更加不合时宜了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ef4928d6dcc722d0bfb7fa723acfe500ecdc0e3bec925a4491f220aed594d1d1","ja":"茜ちゃんとしたことが、盲点だったよ。\nまさか、こんな落とし穴があったなんて……。","zh":"就连小茜都没注意到，真是个盲点啊。\n没想到竟然还有这样的陷阱……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3dd9fa28dc7c31ee758c5c25e9dcfee2f7ff8360493c12fbb98aff7be31e3e5f","ja":"ハロウィン抜きの『TRICK&TREAT』なんて、\nただの『ぷっぷかプリン』じゃないか！！","zh":"没有万圣节元素的《TRICK&TREAT》，不就只是“噗噗卡布丁”吗！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e48d9597d3d4e26749abcb4554d4c691901346f5bc5121ff0da7a3decfe6b033","ja":"え～っ！　茜ちゃんは、\n『ぷっぷかプリン』じゃダメなの？","zh":"诶～！小茜的话，\n“噗噗卡布丁”不行吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"445c5fa632f2409c0967f8ee900ba21160da7c5e964ec81a48365c71442173f0","ja":"ダメ……じゃないよ。でも、せっかく\n『TRICK&TREAT』に来たオファーなんだし……。","zh":"也不是……不行。不过，这可是难得找上『TRICK&TREAT』的邀约……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"59bab54c032701fa3b0186834594c27485b1f6bb7937e3efad8b8b6e4fe74817","ja":"ここは、100億人の『TRICK&TREAT』ファンの\n期待に、バッチリ応えてあげるところじゃない？","zh":"这里不正是要好好回应100亿名《TRICK&TREAT》粉丝期待的地方吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4b46977da53ee5b7a89426784708fbc00b25b39661561470febe045c9f2c281f","ja":"そっか……。じゃあ、イベントの日を\nハロウィンに変えちゃうのはどう？","zh":"这样啊……那把活动日期改成万圣节怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"e9d63ce98352066eae636d7f805cb2cbb7d7c510b2dceba5d01c57daf1d3c485","ja":"たとえば……街がゾンビでいっぱいになったら、\nハロウィン、って感じになるんじゃないかな♪","zh":"比如说……要是街上到处都是丧尸，就会很有万圣节的感觉吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"24b67a66157cc133ded8b19dafd7f7c2717fc4cf7ff6ae22994e02ea064810aa","ja":"う、う～ん！　今ここでうなずいたら、\n世界が滅亡へと向かう気がする！　なんでかニャ～？","zh":"呃、呃——！要是现在在这里点头，总觉得世界会走向毁灭！这是为什么喵～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"f68ea5079d3c93efa92968fa93698ae5bb35607ada1b6dbb2d5cc0b291d28209","ja":"じゃあ偉い人にお願いして、ハロウィンを\n増やしてもらっちゃおう！　1年に400日くらい！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4fbfc33efdbc19b8877fb06088b43bea6b50586f37548637c8f1851de5dfcfac","ja":"それは神様に頼まないとダメなレベルかな……。","zh":"那已经是得拜托神明才能解决的程度了吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"94ae05aec0e238f6917fb5efac26572806fee2c24c318fa7c3eff1de939538d5","ja":"まあ、茜ちゃんのおねだりなら、\n神様もメロメロだろうけど！","zh":"不过，要是小茜开口央求的话，连神明都会为之倾倒吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"12dfd71d0b95923136e1f86f1cfbbd062163c39e2ae4d7276e70700b9e65e22e","ja":"わあ、さすが茜ちゃん！\nじゃあ、あとは神様に会いに行くだけだね♪","zh":"哇，不愧是小茜！\n那么，接下来只要去见神明就好了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_864.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"cb833fc14dd4e583e6b2ca575b9e546d519ffe6225dd56e28e6be21b6019bf63","ja":"えっ！　やっ……やっぱり、\n茜ちゃんには、まだちょっと早いかな～！？","zh":"咦！果……果然，小茜对我来说还是有点早了吧～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
